HaishinKit RTC includes libdatachannel 0.24.3 (MPL-2.0) and its pinned
libjuice (MPL-2.0), libsrtp (BSD-3-Clause), usrsctp (BSD-3-Clause),
plog (MIT), nlohmann/json (MIT), and Mbed TLS 3.6.5 (Apache-2.0) dependencies.
License texts are included in this directory.

