https://github.com/paullouisageneau/libdatachannel/tree/c6696d157b5612df2a741d9a03b192b47ab6cefb
https://github.com/paullouisageneau/libdatachannel/blob/c6696d157b5612df2a741d9a03b192b47ab6cefb/.gitmodules
